{"slug":"Project:-Afternight-PA-autoplayer-34960","_id":"67f689988e05ae6416f15465","title":"PA autoplayer","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77eed","gameId":13042495892,"name":"Project: Afternight","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":13042495892},"features":"Hey everyone! I've got this nifty script for Project: Afternight that keeps autoplay running non-stop. Originally, you had to execute it every new song, but I made a small modification in the code, so no more re-enabling it after every song. Big shoutout to @scriptguy-u3l on Youtube for the original script; all goes to them. I just tweaked it a bit to make the autoplay experience smoother. Enjoy!","tags":["autoplay","project afternight","afternight","autoplayer"],"script":"function getGameFramework()\n    for _, v in next, getgc(true) do\n        if type(v) == 'table' and rawget(v, 'SetAutoplay') then\n            return v\n        end\n    end\nend\n\nlocal framework = getGameFramework()\nif framework then\n    spawn(function()\n        while true do\n            framework.SetAutoplay(true)\n            wait(1)  -- adjust the interval to whatever time you want\n        end\n    end)\nend\n","owner":{"_id":"6687dacebe6c92722c446f3a","username":"mxthquz","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/5896570603646ef5efe870dd0496fd68d5f85e5bd626921ac328815ea720367c.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6687dacebe6c92722c446f3a-1725195289203.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6687dacebe6c92722c446f3a","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/5896570603646ef5efe870dd0496fd68d5f85e5bd626921ac328815ea720367c.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6687dacebe6c92722c446f3a-1725195289203.jpg"}},"verified":false,"views":21685,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":fals